<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK MAY DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.36 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK MAY DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.36 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Friday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the</p>
<p>rest of the month was 6.36 billion markka SPFH.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for May 6			 3,400</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for May		6,362</p>
<p> Average reserves to April 30			 6,900</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,359</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
